 ('Control rhetorical emphasis','Revise a formal application so its strongest evidence receives emphasis without overstating achievements or disparaging other applicants.',[ex('Choose responsible emphasis.','Explain the action and why it matters.','Invent a dramatic result for attention.','Emphasis must preserve truth.'),ex('Choose a useful deletion.','Remove praise that adds no information.','Remove every factual limitation.','Cut repetition rather than honesty.')]),
